  "[action] The second son sets up his grain market.",
  "[action] (to the second son) eldest son gives son money",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and he gives me a little money from the grain market I have set up, and I am content with that.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"And well, and it is enough for me, with the little I have, and what I have I have earned with my own hands on the land. And I have no desire for more.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung goes out to the land.",
  "[says] (to the second son) The eldest son speaks to his brother.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and am I not your father, and will you talk thus to your brother?\"",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son argues with his father.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what, then?\"",
